<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 04-MAY.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 04-MAY.</headline>
<text>
<p>Cleanup continues along the Red River in the upper Plains of the USA, and cleanup will begin in the coming days in southern Manitoba, near Winnepeg, as waters begin to recede. No sigificant storminess is expected in these areas.  </p>
<p>There are no further statements at this time.</p>
</text>
